<header>
  <h1><highlight>MACI: Multi-Agent Collaborative Intelligence</highlight></h1>
  <slogan>The Original Framework for Coordinating LLMs with Divergence-Aware Reasoning and Agentic Design.</slogan>
  <p><em>Documenting the evolution of MACI since 2022 — from Socratic prompting and robust reasoning to AGI-ready orchestration.</em></p>
</header>


<br><br>
<a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F26PB4G9">
    <img src="img/MACI-Cover-Full.jpg" alt="SocraSynth" style="width:900px; height:auto; border:1px solid black;">
